- row  S3  round trip  one chain both leaves and re-enters a representation: `.s … .tt`, `.toString … .tt`, `.stdlib … .to[…]`, `Array.unsafeJvm … Array.unsafeFrozen`, `.s … .nn.tt` around a Java call  +3
